          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pishnahâd kardan pairs pishnahâd, \"suggestion\", with kardan. pishnahâd is pish, \"forward\", with nahâd, \"placed\" (from nahâdan, \"to put\"): something put forward. All the pieces are native Persian. kardan, \"to do\", is an inherited verb, from Middle Persian kardan (EtymDB)."
